{
  "name": "Supabase pgvector 向量知識庫與 AI 語意搜尋",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🧠 範例 5：Supabase pgvector 向量知識庫\n\n1. **Chat Trigger**：提供互動對話視窗。\n2. **AI Agent**：結合 RAG 檢索工具的智慧核心。\n3. **Supabase Vector Store**：連接 Supabase 雲端 PostgreSQL 的 `documents` 表。\n4. **Embeddings 模型**：將使用者問題轉換為 1536 維向量進行語意相似度比對。\n5. **無幻覺回答**：AI 嚴格依據檢索到的文件內容給出精準解答。",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 500
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        100
      ],
      "id": "pgvector-note",
      "name": "流程說明"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        400
      ],
      "id": "chat-trigger-rag",
      "name": "When chat message received"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "你是一位企業內部知識庫顧問。請使用繁體中文回答使用者問題，回答必須嚴格依據檢索到的知識庫內容。若知識庫查無資料，請禮貌告知「目前知識庫中查無此相關資料」。"
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        100,
        400
      ],
      "id": "supabase-rag-agent",
      "name": "Supabase RAG 智慧問答代理"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -80,
        640
      ],
      "id": "rag-openai-model",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
